# Contact form — hosted by Formspree (free plan: 50 messages/month).
#
# The site already uses https://formspree.io/f/xzezjbgb by default (see astro.config.mjs → env.schema).
# Only set this to send the form somewhere else: locally in `.env`, or as a build variable in Cloudflare.
# The value is public (it ends up in the page HTML); it is not a secret.
# PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
